## The wider court's authored content, as compact tables. gen_court_content.gd
## turns these into CourtRegionContent .tres files under data/regions/spring_court/.
##
## Forage spec: "item_id|habitats|weight|cluster_min-cluster_max|flags"
##   habitats comma-separated ("" = the default habitat); flags: c = collectible,
##   n = night-only, C = canon, ? = canon-verify (default invented, [X]).
## Decor spec:  "mesh_id|habitats|density per 100 m²|flags" flags: t = tree, s = casts shadow, w0 = no wind.
## Habitat:     [tag, shape, cx, cz, radius, inner_or_band_min, priority, exclusive]
##   shape: "circle", "ring", "river" (cx/cz unused; radius = band_max, inner = band_min),
##   "rect" (cx, cz = min corner; radius, inner = max x, max z).
## Anchors:     [story anchor id, x, z, yaw_degrees, clear radius m] (docs/contracts/story_anchors.md)
## Gates:       [region_id it opens, x, z, width m, yaw_degrees] (a RegionGate thorn wall)
## Landmark:    [id, name, x, z, height_m, kind, assets (comma), canon, notes, (offsets "x:z;x:z")]
##   kind "waterfall": the first offset is where the water lands, relative to (x, z).
class_name CourtContentTable
extends RefCounted

